{"lang":"en","summary":"Navigation: 主流框架MOC | 面试总览","html":"<pre class=\"frontmatter language-yaml\" style=\"display: none; overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-yaml is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token key atrule\">title</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"Semantic Kernel（微软Agent框架）\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">type</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> interview\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">topic</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"主流框架\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">difficulty</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> intermediate\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">importance</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> medium\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">tags</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> agent/主流框架\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> type/interview\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> diff/intermediate</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Navigation</strong>: <a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E4%B8%BB%E6%B5%81%E6%A1%86%E6%9E%B6MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E4%B8%BB%E6%B5%81%E6%A1%86%E6%9E%B6MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">主流框架MOC</a> | <a data-href=\"面试总览\" href=\"面试总览\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">面试总览</a></p>\n<h1 data-heading=\"Semantic Kernel（微软Agent框架）\" dir=\"auto\">Semantic Kernel（微软Agent框架）</h1>\n<h2 data-heading=\"问题\" dir=\"auto\">问题</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">请介绍微软Semantic Kernel框架的核心概念（Kernel、Plugin、Planner），以及它与微软新推出的Agent Framework的关系。</p>\n<h4 data-heading=\"答案\" dir=\"auto\">答案</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Semantic Kernel核心概念</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Semantic Kernel（SK）是微软开源的AI开发框架，专注于将LLM能力与现有代码库集成。其设计哲学是\"<strong>AI与代码的双向融合</strong>\"——既可以从代码中调用AI能力，也可以让AI调用代码能力。</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>三大核心抽象：</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li dir=\"auto\" class=\"\">\n<p><strong>Kernel（内核）</strong>：中央协调器，管理AI服务、插件和记忆</p>\n<pre class=\"language-csharp\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-csharp is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token class-name\"><span class=\"token keyword\">var</span></span> builder <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> Kernel<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">CreateBuilder</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\nbuilder<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">AddOpenAIChatCompletion</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"gpt-4\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> apiKey<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token class-name\"><span class=\"token keyword\">var</span></span> kernel <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> builder<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">Build</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">\n<p><strong>Plugin（插件）</strong>：功能封装单元，分为两类</p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>Native Functions</strong>：原生C#/Python函数，AI可以调用</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>Semantic Functions</strong>：基于Prompt的语义函数</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">\n<p><strong>Planner（规划器）</strong>：自动任务规划组件，将目标分解为执行步骤</p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><code class=\"code-styler-inline\">SequentialPlanner</code>：顺序规划</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><code class=\"code-styler-inline\">StepwisePlanner</code>：逐步规划（ReAct风格）</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>代码示例：Semantic Kernel基本使用</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> semantic_kernel <span class=\"token keyword\">as</span> sk\n<span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> semantic_kernel<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>connectors<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>ai<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>open_ai <span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> OpenAIChatCompletion\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 1. 创建Kernel</span>\nkernel <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> sk<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>Kernel<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\nkernel<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>add_service<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>OpenAIChatCompletion<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>service_id<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"gpt-4\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> ai_model_id<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"gpt-4\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 2. 定义Semantic Plugin（Prompt函数）</span>\nplugin <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> kernel<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>create_plugin_from_prompt_directory<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"Plugins\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"WritingPlugin\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 3. 定义Native Plugin（代码函数）</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">MathPlugin</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token decorator annotation punctuation\">@sk<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>function</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>name<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"add\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">add</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> a<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> b<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token builtin\">float</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>a<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">+</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">float</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>b<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\nkernel<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>add_plugin<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>MathPlugin<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"MathPlugin\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 4. 使用Planner自动规划</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> semantic_kernel<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>planning <span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> SequentialPlanner\n\nplanner <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> SequentialPlanner<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>kernel<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\nplan <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">await</span> planner<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>create_plan<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"写一篇关于AI安全的博客并计算字数是否超过500\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\nresult <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">await</span> plan<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>invoke<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>kernel<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>与Microsoft Agent Framework的关系：</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">2024年10月，微软推出了新的<strong>Microsoft Agent Framework</strong>，它是Semantic Kernel和AutoGen的融合进化版：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>框架</th>\n<th>定位</th>\n<th>状态</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Semantic Kernel</td>\n<td>底层SDK，AI与代码集成</td>\n<td>持续维护</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AutoGen</td>\n<td>多Agent对话框架（微软研究院）</td>\n<td>核心能力被吸收</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Microsoft Agent Framework</strong></td>\n<td>统一的企业级Agent框架</td>\n<td>新的主推方向</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p dir=\"auto\">新框架的四大支柱：</p>\n<ol>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>开放标准</strong>：支持MCP、A2A、OpenAPI</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>研究管道</strong>：AutoGen的多Agent编排模式（群聊、辩论、反思）</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>可扩展性</strong>：模块化架构，YAML/JSON声明式定义</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>生产就绪</strong>：OpenTelemetry可观测性、Entra ID认证、CI/CD支持</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 data-heading=\"延伸追问\" dir=\"auto\">延伸追问</h4>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>追问1</strong>：Semantic Kernel的Planner与LangChain的Agent有什么区别？\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\">答：SK的Planner更强调\"计划先行\"——先生成完整执行计划再执行；LangChain的Agent是\"边做边想\"的ReAct模式。SK的计划更可控，LangChain的Agent更灵活。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 data-heading=\"常见误区\" dir=\"auto\">常见误区</h4>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>误区</strong>：Semantic Kernel已经被微软放弃了。</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>纠正</strong>：Semantic Kernel仍在持续维护，其能力被整合进新的Microsoft Agent Framework中。对于.NET开发者，SK仍是微软生态的首选Agent SDK。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<hr>\n<h2 data-heading=\"相关知识点\" dir=\"auto\">相关知识点</h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E4%B8%BB%E6%B5%81%E6%A1%86%E6%9E%B6MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E4%B8%BB%E6%B5%81%E6%A1%86%E6%9E%B6MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">主流框架MOC</a></li>\n</ul>","headings":[]}